ers.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0257-dcde32038bce:d00\", \"start\": 547, \"end\": 585, \"text\": \"\\\"The Chronicle of Philanthropy\\\" ranked\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0257-dcde32038bce:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 159, \"text\": \"than 50,000 trained professionals , there are over 4,000 autonomous local clubs , affiliates of the national organization , serving 4.2 million boy and girls .\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0257-dcde32038bce:d01\", \"start\": 160, \"end\": 276, \"text\": \"Clubs are located in all 50 states , Puerto Rico , the Virgin Islands , and on U.S.military bases around the world .\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0257-dcde32038bce:d01\", \"start\": 277, \"end\": 376, \"text\": \"Early History of Boys Clubs The First Club : The first known club was known as “ The Dashaway Club.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0257-dcde32038bce:d01\", \"start\": 377, \"end\": 494, \"text\": \"” It was founded in 1860 in Hartford , Connecticut by Elizabeth Hammersley and two sisters , Mary and Alice Goodwin .\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0257-dcde32038bce:d01\", \"start\": 495, \"end\": 519, \"text\": \"It began very casually .\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0257-dcde32038bce:d01\", \"start\": 520, \"end\": 540, \"text\": \"The three women took\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0257-dcde32038bce:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 108, \"text\": \"were part of the Federated Boys Clubs that formed in 1906 as the precursor to Boys & Girls Clubs of America.\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0257-dcde32038bce:d02\", \"start\": 109, \"end\": 258, \"text\": \"Currently, Boys & Girls Clubs of Philadelphia is made up of at 16 Clubs which are serving youths across Philadelphia’s most impoverished communities.\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0257-dcde32038bce:d02\", \"start\": 259, \"end\": 438, \"text\": \"For the past 129 years, the Boys & Girls Clubs have been dedicated to ensuring that Philadelphia’s most economically disadvantaged youth have opportunities to enhance their lives.\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0257-dcde32038bce:d02\", \"start\": 439, \"end\": 522, \"text\": \"In 2012 Boys & Girls Clubs of Philadelphia celebrated their 125th year anniversary.\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0257-dcde32038bce:d02\", \"start\": 523, \"end\": 611, \"text\": \"In the same year, the first husband and wife CEO Team; Joseph & Lisabeth Marziello, were\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0257-dcde32038bce:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0257-dcde32038bce:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"local clubs\", \"scope\": \"as of 2010\", \"claim\": \"As of 2010, the Boys & Girls Club has over 4,000 local clubs.\", \"answer\": \"over 4,000\", \"quote\": \"As of 2010, there are over 4,000 autonomous local clubs, which are affiliates of the national organization.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0257-dcde32038bce:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0257-dcde32038bce:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"local clubs\", \"scope\": \"Boys & Girls Club\", \"claim\": \"The Boys & Girls Club has over 4,000 autonomous local clubs.\", \"answer\": \"4,000\", \"quote\": \"than 50,000 trained professionals , there are over 4,000 autonomous local clubs , affiliates of the national organization , serving 4.2 million boy and girls .\", \"original_document_number\": 2}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0257-dcde32038bce:d02\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0257-dcde32038bce:d02:c0\", \"entity\": \"local clubs\", \"scope\": \"Boys & Girls Clubs of Philadelphia\", \"claim\": \"Boys & Girls Clubs of Philadelphia is made up of 16 Clubs.\", \"answer\": \"16\", \"quote\": \"Currently, Boys & Girls Clubs of Philadelphia is made up of a